{'symbol': 'ADBE', 'date': '2023-03-22 09:00:00', 'title': 'GENERAL MOTORS SELECTS ADOBE EXPERIENCE CLOUD TO DELIVER REAL-TIME CUSTOMER ENGAGEMENT AND PERSONALIZED EV JOURNEYS', 'text': "LAS VEGAS--(BUSINESS WIRE)--TODAY, AT ADOBE SUMMIT – THE WORLD'S LARGEST DIGITAL EXPERIENCE CONFERENCE – ADOBE (NASDAQ:ADBE) ANNOUNCED THAT GENERAL MOTORS (GM) HAS SELECTED ADOBE EXPERIENCE CLOUD TO DELIVER ONE-TO-ONE PERSONALIZED INTERACTIONS AT SCALE FOR MILLIONS OF ITS CUSTOMERS."}